; Sift's REUSABLE ppx rules (the [@@deriving sift] / [@@deriving model] codec + Fields deriver) as a
; plain library — NOT a ppx_rewriter. Any driver links it to register the rule in its single ppx pass:
; fennec's fur.ppx and the standalone fennec.pulse.sift.ppx both do, and a downstream user can too. Owns
; no runtime; generates Sift.* code. Ships with the Sift package.
(library
 (name sift_ppx_rules)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
